{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:12 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>石鼓洲綜合廢物管理設施第1期發生三級火，至少1人受傷送院。事發於今日（26日）中午12時43分消防接報，指上址發生火警，濃煙席捲半空。消防接報到場開喉灌救，至下午1時24分火警升為三級，出動至少兩喉兩煙帽隊在場撲救。據悉，焚化廠約900多名員工，正陸續坐船離開石鼓洲。</p>\n<img alt=\"網傳火場內部照片。Threads：xxawm\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef591fe3d491e99f94f5aad7798849d9/2026-10/864734701_17951964132313411_2160442176227634639_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"濃煙直衝半空。Threads：xxawm\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e668dd2494cbf9e56269127afbfd613/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-26-15h24m31s546.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批工人疏散。Threads：xxawm\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a54f9317f4ea6d5177e04915b9f7b0a/2026-10/vlcsnap-2026-10-26-15h24m37s153.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"焚化廠濃煙離遠可見。Threads：goblin_under\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f951557f3310749a6bb544ae443a85ec/2026-10/0007bd4d-bf86-48ec-bffb-4ff01697a9c0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防輪出動撲救。FB：香港交通及突發事故報料區\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d9be3e46f39638911289654b3e989e5/2026-10/862466770_3812224962249762_4627306610186283828_n.jpg\"/>\n<p>消防處下午2時40分仍在滅火，處方呼籲市民受到隨風飄散的煙霧和異味影響，請關閉門窗及保持鎮定。下午3時半左右，實時航班網頁顯示政府飛行服務隊出動兩部直升機協助救援，據報火警中有至少一名傷者，獲送往東區醫院救治。目前起火原因仍待調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"工人坐船疏散。Threads：edward.chung_\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/471993ca6ef5606a03158202df56374e/2026-10/i3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疏散工人坐船至荃灣碼頭離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b923c5fe6c364d24ad3c2d1fd3f07aa/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_48_17.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疏散工人坐船至荃灣碼頭離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b85febfd2066b0625490f881f7c5539/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_48_18.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疏散工人坐船至荃灣碼頭離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3e924ea860e6e8e5795fc8c92f5c4c9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_15_48_18_1_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:29.893015+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:40:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:21.389409+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:21.389409+00:00","content_hash":"9a4d0ae1eb87abb04abd7679c77f42c8082d4e101f036ed4d60f01b7f2377b5e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}